{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53399","headline":"孤竹 · 段弘古","name":"孤竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭亭骨屹短墙颠，摇曳空明漾素妍。\n带雨微添寒鹤泪，淩霜不受野云怜。\n老松立地同高节，芳草何心吊[谪]（滴）仙。\n抱此孤根滋九畹，青山一道送流泉。\n（见道光刊本邓显鹤辑《沅湘耆旧集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段弘古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}